0..77 Comment "// A case on a value of a family with a parameter. The goal of the case reads"
78..91 Comment "// the value."
92..94 Comment "//"
95..168 Comment "// The lowering names no classifier for the constructors of a family with"
169..245 Comment "// parameters. So it keeps the scrutinee in the goal as written. A goal that"
246..319 Comment "// reads the scrutinee must still meet each arm at the arm\'s constructor."
320..322 Comment "//"
323..395 Comment "// The checker reads the scrutinee\'s type at the case. It reads the kept"
396..466 Comment "// scrutinee as the case\'s own binder in the motive, and as each arm\'s"
467..541 Comment "// constructor over the arm\'s fields. The checker also generalises a later"
542..615 Comment "// binder whose type reads the scrutinee. A recursion on such a scrutinee"
616..658 Comment "// recurses on a field of the constructor."
659..661 Comment "//"
662..677 Comment "// - see: #5337"
678..757 Comment "// - see: #616 — the lowering keeps the scrutinee of a family with parameters"
758..838 Comment "// - see: #5324 — the generalisation over a later binder that the motive reads"
